{"title":"2026 BmMT Individual Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_BmMT_Individual_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Aarush writes the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> on a whiteboard. Every minute, he replaces the current number on the whiteboard, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a5dcc157a1564c55ef9cb3c70f05b8473bf1a09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 - n$\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />. What number is written on the board after 2026 minutes?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_BmMT_Individual_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After 1 minute, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/2/9520047de72be559e5dd6ab547a63fd3601692b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1^2 - (-1) = 1 + 1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"190\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>After 2 minutes, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/8/36846ce22bd3b043af918375d9806d2e7e75c829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2 - 2 = 4 - 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>We realize that no matter what, the number on the whiteboard will stay at 2 after the second minute. \n</p><p>Therfore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/e/b5e8656291085c388b48a0fa8da85aed21c483bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~xue1\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034501\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 29/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1055/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37861:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018034501 and revision id 292532. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}